2. **Sweep organisation.** Build cache keyed by (n′,m′,ℓ) (133 keys at D ≤ 200); kills per row
   (1,420 charts) — at the banked per-chart cost (2–10 s exact-Q after build, build dominating) this
   is a day of machine time once the builder exists, mechanizable and NOT a proof of anything beyond
   D = 200.
3. **Cofinal structure.** The census is cofinally nonempty (17(v)); the sweep never ends. The
   uniform objects are the u_s = 1 rays indexed by d_s (ℓ = d_s − 3) at fixed (e,d) and depth. The
