/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:141:## 3. Q2 — twelve live rows, six characteristic towers, one finite theorem
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:164:These are **four coarse degree/Jacobian bins, six characteristic towers, twelve V-labelled rows**. Eleven descendants have s'=3 and one has s'=4. None is an s'=2 K16/Appendix-II receiver. The terminal anchors n'-M'_last-1 are respectively 2,8,18,6,9,3, all positive; an old zero-anchor repair is not the issue. The auxiliary degrees follow Moh's characteristic recurrence, not a new size estimate: their maximum is 149. Pair degree at most 24 therefore does not imply a small full-tower coefficient system.
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:176:## 4. Q3 — compression is an optimization to prove, not an H1 theorem
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:186:| Source rows in the selected cohort | 296 |
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:187:| Four-integer keys (n',m',ell,V2') | **132** |
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:189:| Fully decorated records retaining inherited M', V, height | 296 |
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:195:Thus the relevant arithmetic ratios are **296/132=2.2424...** and **296/52=5.6923...**. The prior 6209->1359=4.5688... computation concerns a different, raw census. Dividing 296 by that ratio to price approximately 65 charts is contradicted by the exact key count. The wider 310-row POLY/ODE cohort gives 140 quadruple keys and 53 triples.
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:199:### 4.1 A two-row falsifier of the proposed class key
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:212:This **does not imply 296 separate Gröbner solves**. It proves that compression needs an additional map. A large common necessary superset can be enough: if every actual descendant maps into it and its ideal is unit, its larger solution set causes no soundness problem. It may even produce greater compression than 132. Conversely, a surviving common superset can require finer branches. The number of distinct decorations is not a lower bound on the number of certificates needed.
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:216:### 4.2 The immediate arrow and the all-degree work
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:218:On the chosen Moh route, the binding routing gap is **receiver coverage**: actual source pair -> licensed descendant -> some exact necessary coefficient ideal that the engine kills. Its payload includes the full effective characteristic tree, correct order/support bounds, every coefficient row, normalization charts, and denominator/vanished-leader branches. Ordinary-support completeness belongs inside this arrow. A uniform K16 identity does not repair it for higher-depth descendants.
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:222:The all-degree path is therefore **conditional**: enumerate a bounded cohort to test the maps; build a receiver atlas and per-source split/radius dispositions; prove coefficient-level emptiness for each atlas family; then prove every remaining parameter family is covered or descends by a well-founded measure. A growing sweep is an instrument and a counterexample detector. It is not a terminating proof until that last covering/reduction theorem exists.
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:224:**Cheapest decisive test:** replay the two (126,84) rows and ask the emitter for its source map, filtration, coefficient ring and complete row inventory. This takes seconds for metadata; allow **90 minutes of human/agent construction and at most eight minutes of exact CAS** for a first shared necessary receiver or an explicit scope refusal. Pass means two verified source maps into one proved necessary ideal; fail means a named omitted hypothesis, not an unexplained timeout. Before any census campaign, count covered source branches, not merely emitted keys. The finite target is 296/296 source records with explicit branch dispositions and zero silently dropped states; it is not 296 immediate deaths.
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:226:## 5. Q4 — the valid dichotomy is wider than the current receivers
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:230:Do not manufacture a new radius gap. The banked `prop63-radius-gate-opus5-20260905.md:139–179` rederives the alternative from Moh's proof: either delta*>=v_s/u_s, licensing Prop. 6.3, or a genuine split occurs in [1,v_s/u_s), with deg p dividing u_s and 2<=q<=deg p<=u_s; the denominator bound is at most u_s. For u_s=1 the split alternative is impossible. Thus “unsplit but radius fails” is not an extra case to reopen. What is missing is a receiver theorem for **every descendant in the licensed alternative**, not just the current two-level normal forms.
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:251:Retain U-NEGATIVE (V2'>d2') as a coverage branch until sourced impossible or assigned a receiver. Do not repeat the old count twenty as current: the later snapshot has zero among its forty-eight height-two u_s=1 descendants. Higher height is directly present: its 1,110 u_s=1 records have heights 2/3/4/5 in counts 48/330/596/136. Neither census fact proves an all-degree statement or realization.
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:253:**The single most valuable next object is a source-to-receiver atlas with certificate pullbacks.** For a source chart ring R_alpha, its necessary ideal I_alpha, a receiver ring S_beta with ideal J_beta, and a declared localization, provide a literal homomorphism
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:262:**Bounded quantity and cheapest test:** first decide the number of the 132 coarse keys with a verified shared receiver, and retain 296 source records with complete branch statuses. Pilot on the explicit collided key (36,24,2,5), one established closed-row control, and the s'=4 finite Moh class. Ninety minutes should buy either three honest interface records or a precise first missing theorem. It should not buy a claim of all-degree reduction. This is the first new lane I would launch.
/tmp/jc2-lane.MMCkx9/inputs/ideation-20260905T0200Z-astra.md:264:## 6. Three idea cards
